# vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/options/tool_call_state.py

`ToolCallStateChatOpenAI`: the OpenAI-compatible chat model used on every non-Anthropic route of the deepagents backend. Some Chat Completions endpoints attach extra per-tool-call fields outside the OpenAI schema; this class captures them from each response and sends them back on the same tool call in later requests.

